    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite monkeys with infinite typewriters will eventually write Shakespeare... right? Find out in this cozy automation idler! Strategically place different kinds of monkeys with typewriters then level them up as you type longer and longer words!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SMASH THAT KEYBOARD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436500/extras/96185d7d4aa11e623e67cca3c1230303.poster.avif?t=1753120447\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436500/extras/96185d7d4aa11e623e67cca3c1230303.webm?t=1753120447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436500/extras/96185d7d4aa11e623e67cca3c1230303.mp4?t=1753120447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place a typewriter next to a monkey so they can start using it! They'll just press random letters but eventually they're bound to stumble across a real word...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SELF-PUBLISHED AUTHOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436500/extras/1f76f0f55a80140562ab3e5cd4b6e095.poster.avif?t=1753120447\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436500/extras/1f76f0f55a80140562ab3e5cd4b6e095.webm?t=1753120447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436500/extras/1f76f0f55a80140562ab3e5cd4b6e095.mp4?t=1753120447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money for each word you type, then use the money to upgrade your monkeys! Buy more monkeys and more typewriters so you can expand your literary horizons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TO THINE OWN MONKEY BE TRUE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436500/extras/6a50f4aa1df65cb03ddf0cbd40b87663.poster.avif?t=1753120447\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436500/extras/6a50f4aa1df65cb03ddf0cbd40b87663.webm?t=1753120447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436500/extras/6a50f4aa1df65cb03ddf0cbd40b87663.mp4?t=1753120447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your monkeys enough to eventually write the works of Shakespeare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple species of monkeys and apes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of upgrades!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic monkey placement!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle elements, the monkeys keep typing while you sleep!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
